description=Experimental automatic F14 runtime for the five attested dependency tuples on KernelSU Next and Magisk. Pair with OcCam Fresh 0.124 in LSPosed scoped to OppoCamera. No Action. Device-qualified only on the measured Cyborg A16 / KernelSU Next environment; other profiles and Magisk are install-eligible and still need controlled device qualification.
